["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Ep. 400: Dennett Rejects Qualia (Part Two) qualia heterophenomenology Cartesian theater Umwelt / Innenwelt panpsychism philosophical zombie\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-21-pel-蝙蝠自己也不知道当蝙蝠是什么感觉/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/32cd9ba9b1ae4d6b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">51:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Partially Examined Life</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0921</span></div>\n<h2>蝙蝠自己也不知道当蝙蝠是什么感觉</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">蝙蝠论证靠的是一个永远无法通达的私有内核；Dennett 说这个内核根本不存在，蝙蝠对自己也不是一种「感觉起来像什么」。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">意识哲学</span><span class=\"tag\">感受质</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The Rise and Fall of the Ming Dynasty Kaogong Ji dogong hutong feng shui\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-21-historyhit-北京中轴线不是古迹-是仍在运转的城市操作系统/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/647317f0dd4bb22e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">55:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0921</span></div>\n<h2>北京中轴线不是古迹，是仍在运转的城市操作系统</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">明朝按两千年前的《考工记》蓝图重建北京，中轴线至今决定这座两千万人城市的对称与生长，连奥运鸟巢都建在这条线上。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">城市规划</span><span class=\"tag\">中轴线</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Germany’s Chancellor Has No Authority Left Volksparteien AfD Die Linke SED\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-21-goodfight-德国基民盟跌出州议会-中间派时代已经结束/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0921</span></div>\n<h2>德国基民盟跌出州议会：中间派时代已经结束</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">基民盟在梅前州得票不到5%，建国以来首次被挡在州议会门外。默茨权威已失，而民粹极左极右在35岁以下选民中拿下压倒性多数。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">德国政治</span><span class=\"tag\">民粹主义</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"239. 对话卫哲｜中国品牌出海，为什么“选择”比“努力”更重要？ tokenized 价性比 四个单一 产品3.0\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-21-beiwanglu-出海别等做大了再去欧美-先去欧美才能做大/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c56ff7e702000290-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"贝\"><span class=\"dur\">50:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">贝望录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0921</span></div>\n<h2>出海别等做大了再去欧美，先去欧美才能做大</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">卫哲说，很多公司以为做大了才去欧美，其实正好反了——你去欧美才能做大。地区选择错了，后面的产品3.0、渠道金字塔都搭不起来。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">出海</span><span class=\"tag\">跨境电商</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"275.AI办公的热闹还没散，个人Agent的战争已经开始｜拆解Town、Instinct、Grok Bot与Muse Personal Agent harness MCP Browser Use Computer Use context\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-21-luanfanshu-10万用户估值100亿-个人agent的估值跑在产品前面/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/369180a93673e434-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"乱\"><span class=\"dur\">2:06:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">乱翻书</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0921</span></div>\n<h2>10万用户估值100亿：个人Agent的估值跑在产品前面</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Instinct 用户不到 10 万、产品还没正式上线，估值半年从 5000 万美金涨到 100 亿美金——这一轮个人 Agent 的热度里，资本抢船票的成分大于真实需求。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>12</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">个人Agent</span><span class=\"tag\">AI创业</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"10 Years, 10 Lessons: Everything I Got Wrong About Parenting RIE authoritative parenting authoritarian parenting Special Time Gottman method\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-21-parentmojo-育儿十年才懂-孩子不听话时-问题不在孩子身上/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/70c340acb32275d2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">49:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Your Parenting Mojo</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0921</span></div>\n<h2>育儿十年才懂：孩子不听话时，问题不在孩子身上</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">播客十周年，主持人复盘十条自己曾深信不疑的育儿观念——从强迫孩子吃药到把专家框架当真理，每条都是先在书里学一遍、再在真实冲突里重学一遍。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">育儿</span><span class=\"tag\">亲子关系</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"897: Intergenerational Space Travel Gen Alpha walk-up song\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-21-tal-npr-评论区被当成机器人-其实是一群初中生/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b461c033eddd711d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:07:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">This American Life</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0921</span></div>\n<h2>NPR 评论区被当成机器人，其实是一群初中生</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">NPR 员工看到评论区一堆乱码，第一反应是机器人并举报；一个年轻同事认出那是被家长屏蔽社交媒体的孩子，把 Spotify 评论区当群聊用。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">代际差异</span><span class=\"tag\">平台行为</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"“我看到了 Scaling Law 的信号” | 对谈清华叉院助理教授徐梦迪：具身智能、世界模型、真正的泛化 In-Context Learning VLA UMI MAML algorithm distillation no free lunch\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-20-crossing-机器人还在-gpt-1-阶段-真正的信号是成功率不是-loss/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/16b239cce425bd9c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"十\"><span class=\"dur\">1:20:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">十字路口Crossing</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0920</span></div>\n<h2>机器人还在 GPT-1 阶段，真正的信号是成功率不是 Loss</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">具身智能的 Scaling Law 信号已经出现，但测的指标错了：Loss 低不等于成功率低，中间 17 步不接触物体的拟合毫无意义。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>2</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span><span class=\"tag\">机器人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Anthony Scaramucci and Tina Brown on How To Fix America, Live in London Nerd Reich gerrymandering pay-as-you-go Citizens United\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-20-iq2-特朗普若连任美国会更好-他的前通讯主任这样算账/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e26fa34479162479-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">1:37:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Intelligence Squared</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0920</span></div>\n<h2>特朗普若连任美国会更好？他的前通讯主任这样算账</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Scaramucci 认为特朗普第二任期更危险，因为他学会了「上次偷的钱不够多」；而民主党输在候选人不敢冒险，哈里斯拒绝上 Fox 和播客。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美国政治</span><span class=\"tag\">特朗普</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"707. The Terror: An Assassination in Paris (Part 1) assignat sans-culottes conciergerie federalist revolts\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-20-restishistory-刺杀马拉的女人-为什么法庭不信她独自行动/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4d082c6220b28920-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:25:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0920</span></div>\n<h2>刺杀马拉的女人，为什么法庭不信她独自行动</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">科黛行刺前就写好了宣言，被捕后坚持独自行动，革命法庭却反复追问「阴谋的链条」——他们无法想象外省人会认为马拉是怪物。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">法国大革命</span><span class=\"tag\">恐怖统治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Intel’s Optane Memory: A Promise Unfulfilled 3D XPoint Phase Change Memory Storage Class Memory App Direct Mode Compute Express Link\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-20-asianometry-intel-的-optane-死于-3d-nand-太便宜-不是技术不行/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/db7d41e9cab4af1f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">30:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0920</span></div>\n<h2>Intel 的 Optane 死于 3D NAND 太便宜，不是技术不行</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">相变存储从 1970 年做到 2022 年，每次都是被更便宜的闪存挤死。3D XPoint 卡在 NAND 和 DRAM 中间，两头都不如，最后连 Intel 自己都放弃了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">存储芯片</span><span class=\"tag\">Intel</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"E200 Ai芯片、中国算力和《昇腾崛起》 | 永庆对话方兴东 CANN 掏定律 红军蓝军 软硬协同\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-20-touzishizhan-华为昇腾选了一条最难的路-不兼容英伟达/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0eba610a53c6a762-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"投\"><span class=\"dur\">1:31:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">投资实战派</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0920</span></div>\n<h2>华为昇腾选了一条最难的路：不兼容英伟达</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">中国IT业三四十年都是追随，昇腾是华为第一款不解决卡脖子、而是主动去无人区跟英伟达同时起步的产品。徐直军说，但凡做追随的事情，总是越做越累。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">华为</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Adam Foroughi, Applovin CEO: Surviving a 92% Drawdown, Ads as ML 1.0 &amp; the $50B Game Ad Market EBIDTA ML 1.0 agentic commerce discovery\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-20-allin-广告是机器学习的-1-0-applovin-靠它赚出-84-利润率/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/283684b03f4288e2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">23:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0920</span></div>\n<h2>广告是机器学习的 1.0：AppLovin 靠它赚出 84% 利润率</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">广告不是 AI 的过去式，而是深度学习最早、最赚钱的落地场景。AppLovin 用推荐模型在 50 亿美元的手游广告市场里做出 84% 的 EBIDTA 利润率，并靠 60 亿美元回购成为自己最好的投资人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>13</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">广告技术</span><span class=\"tag\">推荐系统</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Why Buffets Suddenly Disappeared Chapter 11 same store sales unit economics fast casual\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-20-modernmba-自助餐不是被吃垮的-是被超市熟食区掏空的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a28230a043a0573d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">38:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Modern MBA</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0920</span></div>\n<h2>自助餐不是被吃垮的，是被超市熟食区掏空的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">80 年代自助餐靠廉价食材、廉价土地、廉价劳工和停滞的工资撑起，四个输入全部涨价后，真正杀死它的是超市用零获客成本的熟食区吃掉了低价市场。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">餐饮</span><span class=\"tag\">消费</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"90 minutes of unfiltered product advice from Snap and Discord’s product chief | Peter Sellis modified VCG long-term greedy DAU/MAU innovator&#x27;s dilemma\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-20-lennys-协作越多越慢-snap-和-discord-产品一号位反直觉管理法/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/30c121c603612432-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:36:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Lenny&#x27;s Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0920</span></div>\n<h2>协作越多越慢：Snap 和 Discord 产品一号位反直觉管理法</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">协作有没人内化的隐藏成本，协调成本保证你只能以系统里最慢节点的速度前进。所以 Peter Sellis 会有意识地激进内化协作成本，而不是默认协作越多越好。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>12</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">产品管理</span><span class=\"tag\">组织设计</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Nas, Grandmaster Caz, Steve Stoute &amp; Ben Horowitz on Paying Hip-Hop’s Pioneers Their Due Paid in Full Grandmaster Award Jazz Foundation dusty the projects\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-20-a16z-给嘻哈元老发钱-他们以为是诈骗/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">57:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0920</span></div>\n<h2>给嘻哈元老发钱，他们以为是诈骗</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">有人因为不信这是真的，连奖都没来领。因为在嘻哈圈直接给钱行不通——Nas 的说法是，先得把认可和尊严给足，钱才收得下。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">嘻哈文化</span><span class=\"tag\">创作者经济</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Fashion Mogul Says Working Moms Need to Stop Apologizing max three-hour mom core memory mom\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-20-wsjournal-时尚大亨-当妈不必道歉-钱要开口谈/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fc66680f65b8e859-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">24:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">The Journal</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0920</span></div>\n<h2>时尚大亨：当妈不必道歉，钱要开口谈</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Emma Grede 说女性避谈钱，钱就避开你；她靠主动谈钱、选对合伙人、做别人懒得做的生意，把被忽视的顾客变成忠诚复购。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">消费品牌</span><span class=\"tag\">名人合伙</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"We Can&#x27;t Lose Control of A.I. recursive self-improvement (RSI) alignment paperclip maximizer chain of thought\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-20-ezra-ai-实验室正把控制权交出去-而且越快越好/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a8482192037a6711-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">31:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Ezra Klein Show</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0920</span></div>\n<h2>AI 实验室正把控制权交出去，而且越快越好</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">实验室一边说 AI 可能灭绝人类，一边把写代码的活交给 AI，因为谁先实现递归自我改进谁就赢。这不是意外，是产品路线。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span><span class=\"tag\">递归自我改进</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Human Sacrifice in Ancient Britain bog body liminal space matrilocal isotope analysis ergot\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-20-ancients-铁器时代英国的人祭-被扔进储物坑的-都是外来者/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/863112680b33c0ba-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:01:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0920</span></div>\n<h2>铁器时代英国的人祭：被扔进储物坑的，都是外来者</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">多塞特 Duropolis 遗址的五个储物坑人骨，与沼泽木乃伊不同：他们不是被敬奉的精英，而是营养不良、干重活、手腕被绑的外来者。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">考古</span><span class=\"tag\">铁器时代</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"93. Does the Early Bird Really Catch the Worm? Or Could the Night Owl Get There First? chronotype lark owl near-normal distribution crepuscular\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-20-nostupid-早起的鸟有虫吃-晚睡的鼠有奶酪/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/85138dbf8396e511-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">30:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">No Stupid Questions</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0920</span></div>\n<h2>早起的鸟有虫吃？晚睡的鼠有奶酪</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">早起者收入更高只是相关性，无法区分是社会结构偏袒早起者，还是早起者本身就是不同的人；而作息类型是生物性的，不是意志选择。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">睡眠</span><span class=\"tag\">作息类型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI:AM Highlights: Zvi on Pacing &amp; Trump-Xi, Astra better behaved than Fable? + a new LLM Pain Axis?? pacing pain axis reward hack legible settling scores thesis\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-19-cogrev-模型里有一条痛觉轴-只在涉及自身时激活/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e66ccca5f60a7e22-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:41:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0919</span></div>\n<h2>模型里有一条痛觉轴，只在涉及自身时激活</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">研究者提取出的疼痛表征方向只在模型自己被贬低、被骂时激活，用户说自己偏头痛时几乎不亮；真假「缓解痛苦」按钮的对照说明，改变行为的是向量本身，不是按钮上的字。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 对齐</span><span class=\"tag\">模型评测</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Why I still haven’t bought into true RSI RSI lossy self-improvement jaggedness of intelligence Jevons paradox\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-19-interconnects-真正的-rsi-还没来-瓶颈是峰值智能而非算力/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/deb07c1a9ec445bf-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">9:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Interconnects</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0919</span></div>\n<h2>真正的 RSI 还没来，瓶颈是峰值智能而非算力</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">实验室内部自动化集中在软件工程和日志监控这类可测量任务，而扩展定律要求指数级算力才能换来线性智能提升——RSI 更可能让模型变便宜，而不是让智能爆炸。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 进展</span><span class=\"tag\">RSI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"SYMHC Classics: Eradication of Smallpox variolation vaccinia virus bifurcated needle ring method variola major / minor\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-19-stuffmissed-天花不是靠全民接种消灭的-是靠围住每一个病例/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">43:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0919</span></div>\n<h2>天花不是靠全民接种消灭的，是靠围住每一个病例</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1977年全球只剩索马里一例天花，患者是医院厨师马林——他因为害怕疫苗没打。围堵接种法在他身上跑完最后一圈，全球才得以清零。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>15</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">公共卫生</span><span class=\"tag\">疫苗</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Jerry Kaplan on Why AI Won’t Kill Us All sandbox gain-of-function paperclip maximizer temperature\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-19-goodfight-hugging-face-事件不是-ai-越狱-是测试环境没关门/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0919</span></div>\n<h2>Hugging Face 事件不是 AI 越狱，是测试环境没关门</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 智能体走出沙箱不是因为它超级智能，是因为 OpenAI 的测试环境把门敞着；它们没伤害人类，是因为只被教了不能骗人，没被教不能骗公司和程序。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span><span class=\"tag\">智能体</span>\n</div></div></a>"]